{
  "id": "SD-19",
  "group": "综合性应用仿真实训项目",
  "title": "4 位环形计数节拍发生器",
  "type": "integrated",
  "modules": [{ "instanceId": "rng1", "moduleId": "mod-dig-ring", "slot": "SLOT_BOX_L1" }],
  "allowedInstruments": ["ins-oscilloscope", "ins-multimeter"],
  "reference": {
    "nets": [
      ["ins-dc-power.V5P", "rng1.VCC", "rng1.R194_CLR", "rng1.R194_S0"],
      ["ins-dc-power.V5N", "rng1.GND", "rng1.R194_S1"],
      ["rng1.CLK_OUT", "rng1.R194_CP"],
      ["rng1.R194_FB", "rng1.R194_SR"]
    ],
    "measurePoints": [
      { "id": "f_clk", "kind": "waveform", "quantity": "frequency", "minCycles": 2, "between": ["rng1.CLK_OUT", "rng1.GND"] },
      { "id": "f_t1", "kind": "waveform", "quantity": "frequency", "minCycles": 2, "between": ["rng1.R194_QA", "rng1.GND"] },
      { "id": "f_j1", "kind": "waveform", "quantity": "frequency", "minCycles": 2, "between": ["rng1.R175_Q1", "rng1.GND"] }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "prepare",
      "text": "保持断电，对比 4 位自启动环形节拍发生器（74LS194 + SR=~(QA|QB|QC)，4 态独热循环、占空比 25%）与 4 位扭环形/约翰逊计数器（74LS175 + 1D=/Q4，8 态循环、占空比 50%）的时序特征。",
      "measurePoints": [],
      "dataTable": "ring_test"
    },
    {
      "id": "wire",
      "text": "断电按 74LS194 自启动环形节拍器接线：+5V→VCC/R194_CLR/R194_S0、GND→GND/R194_S1（右移模式）、CLK_OUT→R194_CP、自启动反馈 R194_FB→R194_SR，点击“检查接线”。",
      "measurePoints": [],
      "checkWiring": true,
      "dataTable": "ring_test"
    },
    {
      "id": "ring_194",
      "text": "设 CLK_RATE=10 Hz，接示波器 CH1→CLK_OUT、CH2→R194_QA（时基 0.2 s/div），上电观察 L_T1→L_T2→L_T3→L_T4 独热节拍依次点亮且自动从 0000 自启动进入 1000，测得 f_T1 = f_CLK / 4 ≈ 2.5 Hz，记录第 1 行。",
      "measurePoints": ["f_clk", "f_t1"],
      "expect": { "measurePoint": "f_t1", "min": 2.35, "max": 2.65 },
      "dataTable": "ring_test"
    },
    {
      "id": "johnson_175",
      "text": "断电再搭建 74LS175 扭环形（约翰逊）计数器：+5V→VCC/R175_CLR、GND→GND、CLK_OUT→R175_CP、R175_NQ4→R175_D1，示波器 CH2 改接 R175_Q1，上电测得 f_J1 = f_CLK / 8 ≈ 1.25 Hz（50% 占空比），记录第 2 行并断电完成思考题。",
      "measurePoints": ["f_clk", "f_j1"],
      "referenceNets": [
        ["ins-dc-power.V5P", "rng1.VCC", "rng1.R175_CLR"],
        ["ins-dc-power.V5N", "rng1.GND"],
        ["rng1.CLK_OUT", "rng1.R175_CP"],
        ["rng1.R175_NQ4", "rng1.R175_D1"]
      ],
      "expect": { "measurePoint": "f_j1", "min": 1.15, "max": 1.35 },
      "recordTable": "ring_test",
      "dataTable": "ring_test"
    }
  ],
  "dataTables": [
    {
      "id": "ring_test",
      "title": "4 位环形与扭环形节拍发生器分频对比",
      "rows": 2,
      "columns": [
        { "id": "f_clk", "title": "时钟频率 f_CLK", "unit": "Hz", "measurePoint": "f_clk", "captureSteps": ["ring_194", "johnson_175"] },
        { "id": "f_t1", "title": "194 环形 f_T1", "unit": "Hz", "measurePoint": "f_t1", "captureSteps": ["ring_194"] },
        { "id": "f_j1", "title": "175 扭环形 f_J1", "unit": "Hz", "measurePoint": "f_j1", "captureSteps": ["johnson_175"] }
      ],
      "sanity": [
        { "column": "f_t1", "min": 0.2, "max": 5, "message": "10 Hz 时钟下四拍环形输出频率应约 2.5 Hz。" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "charts": [],
  "questions": [
    "普通环形计数器直接将 QD 接回 SR 为何不能自启动？改接反馈函数 SR = ~(QA | QB | QC) 后为何能消除 0000 等无效死循环？",
    "4 位环形计数器与 4 位扭环形（约翰逊）计数器分别有多少个有效状态？各自输出波形的占空比有何区别？",
    "在数字系统控制器中，四拍独热环形节拍信号常用于完成什么任务？"
  ]
}
